            "原文": "During the reporting period, for raw material procurement, a total of 29 on-site empowerment was carried out, while 22 suppliers participated in outbound inspection empowerment, which enhanced the suppliers' ability in production site management and shipment quality control; for the suppliers of finished products of the key categories, a total of 2 quality improvement training camps held for were held to provide professional knowledge training for 42 suppliers. Moreover, 9 key suppliers were provided with multi-stage and all-round empowerment covering 5S management, lean production transformation, and innovation capability enhancement."
